n the four minutes of added time, the drama reached its peak. Twente pushed everyone forward in a final assault on the home goal. In the 94th minute, Marko Pjaca struck again, finding the net to silence the home fans and secure his second goal of the night. The referee blew the final whistle immediately after the restart, ending a classic 3-3 draw that left both sets of players and fans breathless."
